  "quality_notes": [
    "Publisher reports SAIDI and SAIFI by PLN service unit, not a complete 38-province standalone series. Each shared-unit value must NOT be copied as a separately observed province value.",
    "Kepulauan Riau has overlapping UID Riau dan Kepulauan Riau and PT PLN Batam; values must NOT be summed or averaged into an unverified provincial number.",
    "The 2023–2025 UIW Papua dan Papua Barat unit label predates the current six-province Papua territorial structure. Separate statistics for Papua Selatan, Tengah, Pegunungan and Barat Daya are not verified here.",
    "Single-province-labelled PLN units should be described as utility service-unit values rather than official geographic province estimates.",
    "Comparisons describe published interruptions but are not causal analysis; confirm severe disturbances, boundary changes and exceptional events before interpreting abrupt shifts (notably Aceh 2025).",
    "National aggregates are publisher-reported, not unweighted averages of reporting units. No imputations, prorating or synthetic province-wide estimates have been introduced.",
    "Source reports document annual observations; a new publication must be independently reviewed before automatic replacement. 2025 table transcribed from PLN Statistics 2025, p.18 (printed), Table 16."
  ]
}
